# The Game Corner (FireRed's MUS_GAME_CORNER): a bright, busy tune in C for the hall of slot machines, a square
# lead that never sits still over stabs of brass and a bouncing bass, with a bell for the coins. Original
# composition for this game (plan 19 · K5).
